# CR 608.2b, 707.10c, 707.10f: a copy of an Aura spell whose only target is illegal as it resolves does not resolve, so it never
# becomes a token. As in the neighbouring scenario Uldaros Theorix casts a copy of Animate Dead aimed at the Ornithopter card in
# Bot1's graveyard, but Bot2, which has had a Soul-Guide Lantern since turn 2, sacrifices it in response and exiles that graveyard.
# The target is gone: no token Animate Dead, and the Ornithopter does not come back. (The copy ceases to exist, CR 707.10a.)

